  "brain_first": "“出现代词先别看意思，先问它到底指谁。”",
  "sort_order": 1035,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1516
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "候选句含 this, these, they, it, such, those。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1517
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1518
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Reference chain：代词必须有清晰前项。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1519
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “出现代词先别看意思，先问它到底指谁。”",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1520
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 代词是七选五最硬的证据之一。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1521
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1522
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 圈候选句所有代词。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1523
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 在空前寻找能匹配的人/物/事件。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1524
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查单复数和类别。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1525
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 再看空后是否继续用同一对象。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1526
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1527
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1528
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1529
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· These methods → 前面应有复数“方法”",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1530
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· This problem → 前面应出现一个问题/现象",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1531
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· They → 前面需有合理复数人物/事物",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1532
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 每个代词都有明确、自然、最近合理的指代。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1533
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 没有指代对象的选项，即使内容很相关，也优先排除。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1534
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1535
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "候选句 This makes the process faster. 前面若只是列“three apps”，而没有一个动作/机",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1536
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "制，“This”就缺清晰指代。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1537
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1538
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看到关键词相同就忽略代词。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1539
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把复数they指向单数名词。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1540
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1541
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 每个代词指谁？",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1542
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 数量一致吗？",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1543
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1544
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1545
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1546
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 七选五代词必须“有家可回”。",
      "sourcePage": 55,
      "sourceIndex": 1547
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1549
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 选项以This开头，必须检查？",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1550
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. They 前面没有复数对象，选项？",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1551
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. such a change 中such需要？",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1552
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 代词线索比主题相近更硬吗？",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1553
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 两个选项纠结时先查？",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1554
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. This具体指什么。；2. 高度可疑。；3. 前文已有某种change/情况。；4. 通常更硬。；5. 代词指代对",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1555
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "象。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1556
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— G2 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“G2”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1557
    }
  ],
